From: Project Luma <engineering@projectluma.org>
Date: Mon, 14 Sep 2026 12:00:00 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] window-drag: Let a secondary click reach the tiling manager

Pressing any extra mouse button during a window drag ended the drag, so
a right-click while holding a window dropped it where it was -- and a
tiling manager then tiled it. Luma uses that right-click as the gesture
for "don't tile this one". While a window
being moved by the pointer, a secondary press or release no longer ends the drag; the
tiling manager sees the button in the pointer state and acts on it.
Keyboard and menu moves, resizes, and every other button behave as before.
---
 src/compositor/meta-window-drag.c | 14 ++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 14 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/compositor/meta-window-drag.c b/src/compositor/meta-window-drag.c
--- a/src/compositor/meta-window-drag.c
+++ b/src/compositor/meta-window-drag.c
@@ -1881,6 +1881,13 @@
   switch (clutter_event_type (event))
     {
     case CLUTTER_BUTTON_PRESS:
+      /* A secondary click while a window is carried by the pointer is a
+       * gesture for the tiling manager, not the end of the drag. */
+      if (clutter_event_get_button (event) == CLUTTER_BUTTON_SECONDARY &&
+          !(window_drag->grab_op & META_GRAB_OP_WINDOW_FLAG_KEYBOARD) &&
+          meta_grab_op_is_moving (window_drag->grab_op))
+        break;
+
       /* This is the keybinding or menu case where we've
        * been dragging around the window without the button
        * pressed, or the case of pressing extra mouse buttons
@@ -1894,6 +1901,13 @@
     case CLUTTER_BUTTON_RELEASE:
       button = clutter_event_get_button (event);
 
+      /* Its release belongs to the same gesture, even when the secondary
+       * button is configured for resizing. */
+      if (button == CLUTTER_BUTTON_SECONDARY &&
+          !(window_drag->grab_op & META_GRAB_OP_WINDOW_FLAG_KEYBOARD) &&
+          meta_grab_op_is_moving (window_drag->grab_op))
+        break;
+
       if (button == 1 ||
           button == (unsigned int) meta_prefs_get_mouse_button_resize ())
         end_grab_op (window_drag, event);
-- 
2.55.0
